  ('AUD-06D109119B', 4, 'Quiet engine again', 'Went on my A8 D4 1.8 TFSI at 70k miles. Everything in the box matched the parts diagram with nothing missing. Locking tools on, marks aligned, and it timed up exactly where it should. Result is no more chain slap on start-up, which was what prompted the job.', 'Emre Bauer', true, TRUE, '2025-06-30T10:01:47.116Z'),
  ('AUD-06D109119B', 3, 'Good part, order the water pump too', 'Went on my A5 8T 2.0 TFSI at 133k miles. Torqued the tensioner to spec and rotated it twice by hand before starting. It developed a light rattle again far sooner than a timing job should need redoing. That said, timing has held perfectly through 12,000 miles since fitting. Would still buy it again.', 'Niall Nair', true, TRUE, '2025-07-20T11:53:26.440Z'),
