  ('AUD-06E109465BD', 4, 'Rattle on start-up gone', 'Second one of these I have bought, this time for the A5 8T. Locking tools on, marks aligned, and it timed up exactly where it should. The chain has proper hardened links rather than the soft pins on cheap copies. Result is the top-end rattle on cold start has completely gone. Will be back for the other side.', 'Lukas Haugen', true, TRUE, '2026-03-31T18:53:20.999Z'),
