  ('AUD-06E115562H', 4, 'No leaks, no fuss', 'Fitted to my 2023 A4 B7. I changed it with the oil at the same service interval. The media feels dense and the end caps are properly bonded rather than glued on thin. Result is shifts are smoother now the transmission has clean fluid and a fresh filter. Good value against the dealer price.', 'Laura Krause', true, TRUE, '2025-07-07T21:43:06.568Z'),
