  ('AUD-4E0615601L', 5, 'Pedal feel transformed', 'Ordered this for my Q8 4M after the original gave up at 155k. The protective coating on the hat means no unsightly rust ring after a wash. The hub face cleaned up first, then these went on with no shimming needed. Result is stopping distance feels shorter and the pedal is firm rather than spongy. Will be back for the other side.', 'Rania Tran', false, TRUE, '2026-02-17T22:24:41.525Z'),
  ('AUD-4F0121251AC', 3, 'Works well, packaging was thin', 'My A3 8V needed this doing at 88k miles. I flushed the system properly and refilled with the correct G13 before bleeding. The core is thicker than the unit it replaced and the fin density is noticeably higher. That said, intake temps dropped noticeably on a long motorway pull. Worth buying, just go in with your eyes open.', 'Amara Larsen', true, TRUE, '2026-06-09T13:06:01.327Z'),
  ('AUD-4F0121251AF', 4, 'Temps back to normal', 'My RS4 B7 needed this doing at 42k miles. I bled it through the proper procedure and it has held level ever since. The end tanks are properly crimped with clean seams all the way round. Result is no more creeping temperature when towing. No complaints at all.', 'Marcus Ellery', true, TRUE, '2026-03-01T06:36:10.422Z'),
  ('AUD-4F0145804K', 5, 'Straight swap', 'Went on my A3 8V 1.4 TFSI at 119k miles. The plastic feels substantial rather than the brittle stuff that cracks at the neck. Front end off, old one out, this one in over a long Saturday. Result is the gauge sits dead centre now even in traffic on a hot day. Good value against the dealer price.', 'Hugo Whitfield', true, TRUE, '2026-01-03T10:33:32.802Z'),
  ('AUD-4F0145804K', 1, 'Seeped from the end tank', 'Ordered this for my A8 D4 after the original gave up at 113k. A weep appeared at the end tank seam after a few heat cycles. I flushed the system properly and refilled with the correct G13 before bleeding. Expected better given the cost.', 'Hannah Kaur', true, TRUE, '2025-07-05T21:29:30.718Z'),
  ('AUD-4F0145804K', 5, 'Solved my overheating', 'Bought for a 2020 Q7 4M. The end tanks are properly crimped with clean seams all the way round. All the mounting points and hose stubs lined up without any persuasion. Result is no more creeping temperature when towing. No complaints at all.', 'Rebecca Rahman', true, TRUE, '2026-05-09T08:35:14.363Z'),
  ('AUD-4F0145804K', 5, 'Perfect fit, no modification', 'Ordered this for my A4 B8 after the original gave up at 62k. The end tanks are properly crimped with clean seams all the way round. I bled it through the proper procedure and it has held level ever since. Result is intake temps dropped noticeably on a long motorway pull.', 'Oscar Okonkwo', true, TRUE, '2025-03-14T11:21:39.360Z'),
  ('AUD-4F0317826B', 3, 'Good value, thin gasket', 'Replacement for my 2017 Q5 8R 2.0 TFSI. It dropped straight into the housing and the cap torqued to spec first go. The outer diameter was a couple of millimetres off and it would not sit square in the housing. That said, no leaks at all after several hundred miles. Would still buy it again.', 'Oscar Bergmann', false, TRUE, '2025-12-11T04:04:20.097Z'),
  ('AUD-4F0413031AM', 4, 'Car feels new again', 'My RS4 B7 needed this doing at 128k miles. I torqued everything at ride height rather than with the suspension hanging. Damping is progressive when you compress it by hand, not dead at the top of the stroke. Result is body roll through roundabouts is properly controlled again. No complaints at all.', 'Elena Novak', true, TRUE, '2025-08-12T00:17:57.444Z'),
