  ('AUD-6Q0882331', 5, 'Primed and ready to paint', 'Went on my A3 8P 3.0 TDI V6 at 167k miles. I lined it up against the door shut and the gap fell straight in. All the mounting tabs and clip locations are present and in the right place. Result is the panel gaps are even down both sides and you cannot tell it was repaired. Happy to recommend it.', 'Claire Bianchi', true, TRUE, '2025-10-27T23:00:06.413Z'),
  ('AUD-6R0615301D', 4, 'Straight, true and quiet', 'Went on my A3 8V 2.0 TFSI at 85k miles. Took my time bedding them in over 200 miles as the instructions ask. The vane casting is noticeably tidier than the budget set I pulled off. Result is stopping distance feels shorter and the pedal is firm rather than spongy. Good value against the dealer price.', 'Tobias Vogel', true, TRUE, '2025-07-28T03:10:23.601Z'),
  ('AUD-6R0615301D', 3, 'Good discs, awkward delivery', 'Second one of these I have bought, this time for the A3 8V. Needed a wind-back tool for the rear calipers but otherwise a straightforward job. Thickness came in bang on the OE figure when I measured it. That said, braking is quiet and progressive where before it grabbed. Would still buy it again.', 'Amara Novotny', true, TRUE, '2025-04-19T00:26:38.348Z'),
  ('AUD-6R0615301D', 4, 'Better than the dealer discs', 'Went on my Q3 8U 2.5 TFSI at 100k miles. Weight and vane count match the originals exactly. Took my time bedding them in over 200 miles as the instructions ask. Result is no vibration through the pedal even on a long downhill run. Exactly what I needed.', 'Elena Whitfield', true, TRUE, '2025-09-18T14:39:23.443Z'),
  ('AUD-6R0819465C', 5, 'Lined up first time', 'Ordered this for my RS4 B7 after the original gave up at 49k. The bodyshop test-fitted it before paint and needed almost no adjustment. The swage lines and body contours follow the original exactly. Result is the panel gaps are even down both sides and you cannot tell it was repaired. Happy to recommend it.', 'Malik Castellanos', true, TRUE, '2025-08-14T01:16:00.010Z'),
  ('AUD-6R0819465C', 5, 'Contours match exactly', 'Went on my TT 8J 1.8 TFSI at 100k miles. The swage lines and body contours follow the original exactly. It clipped into the factory mounting points without drilling anything. Result is the panel gaps are even down both sides and you cannot tell it was repaired. Good value against the dealer price.', 'Niall Marchetti', true, TRUE, '2025-04-17T23:29:58.915Z'),
  ('AUD-7B0615301B', 4, 'Straight, true and quiet', 'Ordered this for my A7 4G after the original gave up at 129k. Needed a wind-back tool for the rear calipers but otherwise a straightforward job. Machining on the friction face is even all the way round. Result is no vibration through the pedal even on a long downhill run.', 'Nora Bianchi', false, TRUE, '2025-11-22T09:47:52.504Z'),
  ('AUD-7L0121253A', 3, 'Fits, but budget a new fan shroud', 'Cross-referenced the OE number against my 2013 A6 C8 before ordering. I bled it through the proper procedure and it has held level ever since. A weep appeared at the end tank seam after a few heat cycles. That said, intake temps dropped noticeably on a long motorway pull. Fine for the money, with that one caveat.', 'Daniel Halvorsen', false, TRUE, '2025-12-07T10:27:46.126Z'),
  ('AUD-80A615601C', 5, 'Judder gone completely', 'Second one of these I have bought, this time for the Q5 8R. The hub face cleaned up first, then these went on with no shimming needed. Weight and vane count match the originals exactly. Result is braking is quiet and progressive where before it grabbed. Would order again without hesitation.', 'Rajesh Rossi', false, TRUE, '2026-08-04T18:59:52.597Z'),
  ('AUD-80A615601C', 5, 'Bedded in perfectly', 'Second one of these I have bought, this time for the Q7 4M. The hub face cleaned up first, then these went on with no shimming needed. The vane casting is noticeably tidier than the budget set I pulled off. Result is braking is quiet and progressive where before it grabbed. Exactly what I needed.', 'Hannah Vance', false, TRUE, '2026-03-29T05:24:13.439Z'),
  ('AUD-80A616039L', 3, 'Good dampers, buy the top mounts too', 'Ordered this for my Q3 8U after the original gave up at 124k. I fitted both sides together as you should, then had it aligned the same week. One unit was visibly weeping oil down the body within a few weeks. That said, the car no longer floats over crests and settles in one movement. Worth buying, just go in with your eyes open.', 'Hugo Duarte', false, TRUE, '2025-10-14T20:17:24.417Z'),
  ('AUD-80A616039L', 4, 'Ride is composed again', 'Bought for a 2014 A5 8T. Spring compressors out and the strut rebuilt on the bench in an afternoon. The paint and plating look like they will survive a few winters of salt. Result is the clonk over speed bumps that started this job has completely gone.', 'Talia Ibrahim', true, TRUE, '2026-05-07T19:30:29.497Z'),
  ('AUD-80A616039L', 3, 'Fine, but get an alignment after', 'Replacement for my 2022 Q7 4L 1.4 TFSI. The garage did the pair and the alignment came back within spec straight away. One unit was visibly weeping oil down the body within a few weeks. That said, the car no longer floats over crests and settles in one movement. Worth buying, just go in with your eyes open.', 'Oscar Bauer', true, TRUE, '2025-06-11T02:20:51.452Z'),
  ('AUD-80A616039L', 4, 'Night and day difference', 'Replacement for my 2016 A3 8P 1.8 TFSI. The weight matches the original almost exactly, which the cheap ones never do. I fitted both sides together as you should, then had it aligned the same week. Result is body roll through roundabouts is properly controlled again.', 'Callum Marchetti', true, TRUE, '2025-12-11T08:55:40.667Z'),
