  ('AUD-8E0121251AJ', 2, 'Seeped from the end tank', 'My Q8 4M needed this doing at 162k miles. Several fins arrived flattened because the box had almost no internal padding. I flushed the system properly and refilled with the correct G13 before bleeding. Would not order the same one again.', 'Hugo Silva', false, TRUE, '2025-08-26T07:53:45.480Z'),
