  ('AUD-8E0121251AQ', 5, 'Better core than the original', 'Cross-referenced the OE number against my 2013 A3 8P before ordering. The end tanks are properly crimped with clean seams all the way round. I bled it through the proper procedure and it has held level ever since. Result is no more creeping temperature when towing. Would order again without hesitation.', 'Tobias Castellanos', true, TRUE, '2025-09-26T03:15:55.334Z'),
  ('AUD-8E0121251AQ', 4, 'Straight swap', 'My A6 C8 needed this doing at 162k miles. I pressure tested it to 1.4 bar before fitting and it held without a drop. I bled it through the proper procedure and it has held level ever since. Result is the coolant level has not moved in four months. No complaints at all.', 'Amara Almeida', false, TRUE, '2025-10-29T18:50:51.895Z'),
