  ('AUD-8MA512131B', 5, 'Car feels new again', 'Replacement for my 2016 Q3 8U 2.0 TDI. Damping is progressive when you compress it by hand, not dead at the top of the stroke. I torqued everything at ride height rather than with the suspension hanging. Result is the clonk over speed bumps that started this job has completely gone.', 'Emre Ibrahim', false, TRUE, '2026-03-21T06:24:53.520Z'),
  ('AUD-8MA601025E', 5, 'Transformed the look', 'Fitted to my 2009 Q8 4M. Weight per corner is genuinely lower than the wheels I took off. Torqued to 120Nm in a star pattern and rechecked after 50 miles. Result is they have been through a winter of salt without a mark on the finish.', 'Ingrid Delgado', true, TRUE, '2025-05-01T22:28:50.194Z'),
  ('AUD-8MA601025E', 2, 'Buckled on a mild pothole', 'Ordered this for my A3 8V after the original gave up at 43k. The lacquer started lifting at the rim edge after a single winter. I had them balanced when the tyres went on and they took almost no weight. Would not order the same one again.', 'Laura Zimmer', true, TRUE, '2026-04-29T17:10:20.378Z'),
  ('AUD-8MA601025E', 4, 'Straight and true', 'Replacement for my 2010 Q3 8U 3.0 TFSI V6. Weight per corner is genuinely lower than the wheels I took off. They bolted straight on with the factory bolts and centred perfectly on the hub. Result is it clears the front calipers with room to spare. Will be back for the other side.', 'Simone Vance', true, TRUE, '2026-01-07T02:39:27.405Z'),
  ('AUD-8MA601025E', 4, 'Balanced with almost no weight', 'Fitted to my 2011 A8 D4. Torqued to 120Nm in a star pattern and rechecked after 50 miles. The lacquer is even and deep, with no orange peel anywhere on the face. Result is no vibration at any speed, right up to motorway limits.', 'Owen Delgado', true, TRUE, '2026-08-01T04:06:38.697Z'),
  ('AUD-8MA601025H', 5, 'Correct offset, no rubbing', 'Replacement for my 2021 Q3 8U 1.8 TFSI. I had them balanced when the tyres went on and they took almost no weight. The casting is clean with no flashing around the spokes or the bolt seats. Result is they have been through a winter of salt without a mark on the finish. Delivery was quick too.', 'Tobias Sorensen', true, TRUE, '2026-05-04T09:48:57.798Z'),
  ('AUD-8MA601025H', 4, 'Transformed the look', 'Went on my A4 B9 1.4 TFSI at 48k miles. The machined face has a consistent finish under direct light. They needed spigot rings for a proper hub-centric fit, which are worth buying alongside. Result is the car sits exactly right with no arch rub on full lock.', 'Sofia Rossi', false, TRUE, '2026-08-01T22:30:16.730Z'),
  ('AUD-8MA615301A', 5, 'Solid replacement discs', 'Bought for a 2010 S3 8V. Thickness came in bang on the OE figure when I measured it. Took my time bedding them in over 200 miles as the instructions ask. Result is no vibration through the pedal even on a long downhill run.', 'Greta Kaur', false, TRUE, '2025-12-15T14:06:00.953Z'),
  ('AUD-8MA615302', 5, 'Better than the dealer discs', 'Went on my A6 C6 2.0 TFSI at 97k miles. Machining on the friction face is even all the way round. Took my time bedding them in over 200 miles as the instructions ask. Result is stopping distance feels shorter and the pedal is firm rather than spongy. No complaints at all.', 'Jonas Brandt', false, TRUE, '2025-08-14T10:31:33.580Z'),
  ('AUD-8MA615302A', 5, 'Pedal feel transformed', 'Ordered this for my Q5 FY after the original gave up at 94k. Machining on the friction face is even all the way round. An independent specialist fitted them and commented on how clean the castings were. Result is stopping distance feels shorter and the pedal is firm rather than spongy. Would order again without hesitation.', 'Jonas Castellanos', true, TRUE, '2025-10-13T11:13:39.588Z'),
  ('AUD-8MA615601', 3, 'Works, but check your part number', 'Replacement for my 2006 A6 C7 2.0 TFSI. An independent specialist fitted them and commented on how clean the castings were. They never fully stopped squealing no matter how carefully I bedded them. That said, braking is quiet and progressive where before it grabbed. Good part, minor niggles.', 'Oscar Bergmann', true, TRUE, '2025-06-04T20:56:32.793Z'),
  ('AUD-8MA615601', 4, 'Pedal feel transformed', 'Bought for a 2009 S4 B8. Swapped them on the driveway with basic tools in about two hours a side. Weight and vane count match the originals exactly. Result is no vibration through the pedal even on a long downhill run. Good value against the dealer price.', 'Felix Marchetti', true, TRUE, '2025-08-03T18:17:32.820Z'),
  ('AUD-8MA615601', 3, 'Decent for the money', 'Second one of these I have bought, this time for the A6 C8. Took my time bedding them in over 200 miles as the instructions ask. Runout measured well within spec on the dial gauge. That said, braking is quiet and progressive where before it grabbed. Fine for the money, with that one caveat.', 'Laura Novotny', true, TRUE, '2025-09-09T10:21:31.218Z'),
  ('AUD-8MA615601', 5, 'Solid replacement discs', 'Fitted to my 2011 A4 B8. The hub face cleaned up first, then these went on with no shimming needed. Machining on the friction face is even all the way round. Result is no vibration through the pedal even on a long downhill run. No complaints at all.', 'Priya Larsen', false, TRUE, '2025-04-21T02:46:05.519Z'),
  ('AUD-8R0133843D', 5, 'Correct fit, sealed properly', 'Bought for a 2017 Q8 4M. I pre-oiled the seal before fitting and there has not been a drop since. The rubber seal is supple and sat in its groove without coaxing. Result is throttle response feels crisper than it did on the clogged original. Would order again without hesitation.', 'Simone Kowalski', true, TRUE, '2025-03-16T13:04:10.985Z'),
  ('AUD-8R0133843D', 5, 'Right filter every time', 'Second one of these I have bought, this time for the A5 F5. I pre-oiled the seal before fitting and there has not been a drop since. The rubber seal is supple and sat in its groove without coaxing. Result is no leaks at all after several hundred miles.', 'Sven Kaur', true, TRUE, '2025-06-30T21:18:19.873Z'),
  ('AUD-8R0615301G', 4, 'Judder gone completely', 'Cross-referenced the OE number against my 2022 A5 F5 before ordering. The hub face cleaned up first, then these went on with no shimming needed. Runout measured well within spec on the dial gauge. Result is no squeal at all, even cold on a damp morning. Cannot fault it.', 'Adrian Mensah', true, TRUE, '2026-02-14T22:02:06.442Z'),
  ('AUD-8R0809837', 5, 'Lined up first time', 'Fitted to my 2007 A4 B8. It came properly primed rather than in bare metal that would flash rust. The bodyshop test-fitted it before paint and needed almost no adjustment. Result is the paint match came out perfectly with no ripple in the reflection. Good value against the dealer price.', 'Emre Nair', true, TRUE, '2026-01-12T22:19:03.039Z'),
  ('AUD-8R0809837', 5, 'Bodyshop was impressed', 'Cross-referenced the OE number against my 2006 A6 C6 before ordering. It came properly primed rather than in bare metal that would flash rust. I lined it up against the door shut and the gap fell straight in. Result is the panel gaps are even down both sides and you cannot tell it was repaired.', 'Greta Halvorsen', true, TRUE, '2025-06-10T14:04:36.956Z'),
  ('AUD-8R0809837', 5, 'Primed and ready to paint', 'Went on my A8 D4 3.0 TFSI V6 at 69k miles. I lined it up against the door shut and the gap fell straight in. It came properly primed rather than in bare metal that would flash rust. Result is it has been on a year now with no sign of corrosion at the seams.', 'Anders Silva', true, TRUE, '2026-06-29T13:05:55.271Z'),
