  ('AUD-8V0615301R', 4, 'Judder gone completely', 'Cross-referenced the OE number against my 2006 Q3 8U before ordering. The protective coating on the hat means no unsightly rust ring after a wash. Carrier bolts came off without a fight and the new discs dropped straight on. Result is braking is quiet and progressive where before it grabbed. Exactly what I needed.', 'Tobias Petrov', true, TRUE, '2025-03-21T08:17:01.335Z'),
