  ('AUD-8V5809838', 5, 'Primed and ready to paint', 'Cross-referenced the OE number against my 2008 A4 B8.5 before ordering. I prepped and painted it in the car colour and it went on in a morning. All the mounting tabs and clip locations are present and in the right place. Result is it has been on a year now with no sign of corrosion at the seams. Cannot fault it.', 'Chidi Novak', false, TRUE, '2025-07-16T15:19:40.638Z'),
  ('AUD-8W0121251AA', 4, 'Temps back to normal', 'Went on my S3 8V 2.0 TFSI at 69k miles. All the mounting points and hose stubs lined up without any persuasion. The plastic feels substantial rather than the brittle stuff that cracks at the neck. Result is the gauge sits dead centre now even in traffic on a hot day.', 'Claire Haugen', false, TRUE, '2025-04-06T14:36:56.327Z'),
  ('AUD-8W0121251AA', 5, 'Holds pressure beautifully', 'Cross-referenced the OE number against my 2020 A3 8V before ordering. All the mounting points and hose stubs lined up without any persuasion. The end tanks are properly crimped with clean seams all the way round. Result is the coolant level has not moved in four months. Delivery was quick too.', 'Sofia Larsen', true, TRUE, '2026-07-21T10:50:57.160Z'),
  ('AUD-8W0121251AA', 3, 'Works well, packaging was thin', 'Fitted to my 2009 A6 C7. Front end off, old one out, this one in over a long Saturday. Several fins arrived flattened because the box had almost no internal padding. That said, intake temps dropped noticeably on a long motorway pull. Worth buying, just go in with your eyes open.', 'Martin Bauer', true, TRUE, '2026-05-06T23:44:15.096Z'),
  ('AUD-8W0133843C', 5, 'Right filter every time', 'Replacement for my 2007 A3 8V 1.8 TFSI. The pleat count is visibly higher than the supermarket filter I had been using. The old one practically fell apart coming out; this went in cleanly. Result is throttle response feels crisper than it did on the clogged original. Good value against the dealer price.', 'Zara Hoffmann', false, TRUE, '2025-09-27T08:19:27.355Z'),
  ('AUD-8W0133843C', 5, 'Exactly what the service needed', 'Fitted to my 2024 Q3 8U. The pleat count is visibly higher than the supermarket filter I had been using. It dropped straight into the housing and the cap torqued to spec first go. Result is the musty smell from the vents has completely gone. Cannot fault it.', 'Sofia Haugen', false, TRUE, '2026-03-13T15:29:55.684Z'),
  ('AUD-8W0133843C', 5, 'Good pleat count', 'Second one of these I have bought, this time for the Q3 8U. I pre-oiled the seal before fitting and there has not been a drop since. The rubber seal is supple and sat in its groove without coaxing. Result is oil pressure comes up as quickly on a cold start as it always has.', 'Viktor Bianchi', true, TRUE, '2025-03-24T20:47:37.742Z'),
