  ('AUD-8W0133843E', 5, 'Correct fit, sealed properly', 'Went on my Q7 4L 1.8 TFSI at 86k miles. It dropped straight into the housing and the cap torqued to spec first go. Dimensions matched the outgoing filter to the millimetre. Result is shifts are smoother now the transmission has clean fluid and a fresh filter. Delivery was quick too.', 'Ingrid Castellanos', true, TRUE, '2026-03-24T08:04:16.863Z'),
