  ('AUD-8W6035411A', 3, 'Good sound, fiddly fitting', 'Cross-referenced the OE number against my 2015 RS4 B7 before ordering. They dropped into the factory location without any adapter rings. One of the pair had a small tear in the surround out of the box. That said, noticeably more detail without having to touch the head unit settings. Would still buy it again.', 'Nora Lindqvist', false, TRUE, '2025-11-04T09:50:47.543Z'),
  ('AUD-8W6035411A', 5, 'Bass without the rattle', 'Went on my S3 8V 1.4 TFSI at 62k miles. Door card off, four screws, and the connector plugged straight in. The terminals are proper spade connectors that match the factory loom. Result is the door card buzz at higher volume has gone completely.', 'Amara Rossi', false, TRUE, '2026-03-09T16:39:37.983Z'),
  ('AUD-8W6035411A', 4, 'Clarity is a big step up', 'Bought for a 2010 Q8 4M. They dropped into the factory location without any adapter rings. The cone and surround feel far more substantial than the paper originals. Result is vocals are clear at volume where the originals used to distort. Delivery was quick too.', 'Amara Novotny', false, TRUE, '2026-08-09T12:46:54.143Z'),
  ('AUD-8W6413031A', 5, 'Correct damping rate', 'Bought for a 2024 Q3 8U. The rod is properly finished with no machining marks and the seal is clean. Spring compressors out and the strut rebuilt on the bench in an afternoon. Result is body roll through roundabouts is properly controlled again. No complaints at all.', 'Freya Whitfield', false, TRUE, '2026-03-04T06:04:47.582Z'),
