  ('AUD-95C615601', 5, 'Judder gone completely', 'Ordered this for my A4 B8.5 after the original gave up at 56k. Needed a wind-back tool for the rear calipers but otherwise a straightforward job. The vane casting is noticeably tidier than the budget set I pulled off. Result is braking is quiet and progressive where before it grabbed.', 'Elena Rahman', false, TRUE, '2026-04-10T09:48:52.846Z'),
  ('AUD-95C615601', 4, 'Exactly the right spec', 'Fitted to my 2012 Q5 8R. Machining on the friction face is even all the way round. Carrier bolts came off without a fight and the new discs dropped straight on. Result is no vibration through the pedal even on a long downhill run. Will be back for the other side.', 'Diego Kaur', true, TRUE, '2025-09-26T21:25:57.116Z'),
  ('AUD-9J1615301A', 4, 'Better than the dealer discs', 'Bought for a 2012 TT 8S. Weight and vane count match the originals exactly. Needed a wind-back tool for the rear calipers but otherwise a straightforward job. Result is eight months and several thousand miles later they are still dead smooth. No complaints at all.', 'Yara Castellanos', true, TRUE, '2026-03-01T09:17:12.673Z'),
  ('AUD-9J1615601', 3, 'Decent for the money', 'Second one of these I have bought, this time for the A6 C7. Carrier bolts came off without a fight and the new discs dropped straight on. Weight and vane count match the originals exactly. That said, eight months and several thousand miles later they are still dead smooth. Fine for the money, with that one caveat.', 'Callum Fitzgerald', false, TRUE, '2025-09-24T00:38:25.996Z'),
  ('AUD-N10825101', 5, 'Right first time', 'Fitted to my 2016 A4 B8.5. Torqued to the manual figure with no sign of stretch. Thread pitch and length are spot on against the old hardware. Result is it came in cheaper than the dealer wanted for the same specification. Cannot fault it.', 'Kwame Weiss', true, TRUE, '2026-02-19T11:43:29.476Z'),
  ('AUD-N10825101', 5, 'Correct thread, correct grade', 'Cross-referenced the OE number against my 2007 A3 8V before ordering. Thread pitch and length are spot on against the old hardware. Torqued to the manual figure with no sign of stretch. Result is everything torqued down evenly with nothing binding. Will be back for the other side.', 'Yara Larsen', true, TRUE, '2026-06-05T05:15:28.469Z'),
  ('AUD-N90641104', 5, 'Correct thread, correct grade', 'Cross-referenced the OE number against my 2008 Q5 FY before ordering. Torqued to the manual figure with no sign of stretch. The head marking and plating match the originals exactly. Result is no corrosion on them after a winter of road salt. Delivery was quick too.', 'Diego Fitzgerald', false, TRUE, '2025-04-04T03:20:28.132Z'),
  ('AUD-N90641104', 4, 'Saved a trip to the dealer', 'Replacement for my 2015 A6 C8 3.0 TFSI V6. Proper grade steel rather than the soft plated stuff that rounds off. They threaded in cleanly by hand before I put a socket anywhere near them. Result is everything torqued down evenly with nothing binding. Exactly what I needed.', 'Thomas Adeyemi', true, TRUE, '2026-05-12T20:29:17.981Z'),
  ('AUD-N91229201', 4, 'Saved a trip to the dealer', 'Bought for a 2009 Q7 4L. Thread pitch and length are spot on against the old hardware. Torqued to the manual figure with no sign of stretch. Result is everything torqued down evenly with nothing binding.', 'Laura Rahman', false, TRUE, '2026-06-19T07:12:40.553Z'),
  ('AUD-N91229201', 4, 'Proper OE spec', 'My A3 8V needed this doing at 95k miles. They threaded in cleanly by hand before I put a socket anywhere near them. Proper grade steel rather than the soft plated stuff that rounds off. Result is it came in cheaper than the dealer wanted for the same specification. Cannot fault it.', 'Hugo Adeyemi', true, TRUE, '2025-04-12T21:21:02.922Z'),
  ('AUD-WHT006099', 1, 'Thread pitch was wrong', 'My TT 8J needed this doing at 111k miles. The pack was two bolts short of the quantity listed. Expected better given the cost.', 'Felix Novotny', true, TRUE, '2026-03-30T09:57:39.046Z'),
  ('AUD-ZAW601002', 5, 'Balanced with almost no weight', 'Cross-referenced the OE number against my 2017 Q7 4L before ordering. They needed spigot rings for a proper hub-centric fit, which are worth buying alongside. The casting is clean with no flashing around the spokes or the bolt seats. Result is it clears the front calipers with room to spare.', 'Lena Whitfield', true, TRUE, '2026-01-25T15:54:38.033Z'),
  ('AUD-ZAW601002', 4, 'Finish is flawless', 'Second one of these I have bought, this time for the S4 B8. The casting is clean with no flashing around the spokes or the bolt seats. They bolted straight on with the factory bolts and centred perfectly on the hub. Result is they have been through a winter of salt without a mark on the finish. Happy to recommend it.', 'Thomas Kaur', false, TRUE, '2025-06-07T02:17:35.425Z'),
  ('AUD-ZAW601002', 2, 'Buckled on a mild pothole', 'Fitted to my 2018 A6 C6. One wheel picked up a buckle from a pothole that should not have troubled it. They needed spigot rings for a proper hub-centric fit, which are worth buying alongside. Disappointing for the price.', 'Marcus Ellery', true, TRUE, '2026-01-26T20:21:36.423Z')
